
### Resume Skills API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5004
@candidateId = 1
@resumeId = 1
@skillId = 1

### 1. Add Java skill
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/skills
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skillName": "Java",
  "proficiencyLevel": "ADVANCED",
  "yearsOfExperience": 4,
  "displayOrder": 1
}

### 2. Add PostgreSQL skill
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/skills
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skillName": "PostgreSQL",
  "proficiencyLevel": "BEGINNER",
  "yearsOfExperience": 2,
  "displayOrder": 2
}

### 3. Get all skills for resume
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/skills

### 4. Update skill
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/skills/{{skillId}}
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skillName": "Java 21",
  "proficiencyLevel": "ADVANCED",
  "yearsOfExperience": 5,
  "displayOrder": 1
}

### 5. Delete skill
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/skills/{{skillId}}
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
